    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Less tired; cold hands</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dental pain</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No palpitations or fainting; ankle swelling gone</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Fullness after meals; no vomiting; bowels regular</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urinary symptoms; no postmenopausal bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No bone pain or fractures</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dry skin; fine hair on the arms</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>Dizziness on standing much less</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low mood and grief; PHQ-9 13</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>11 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

