    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with her consent, because she travels for long periods and has a serious illness. She named a health care agent and a second agent, and a health care proxy form was completed; both are recorded in the restricted chart and are not named here. She wants full treatment of any medical complication, including hospital care for her eating disorder if her team advises it, and she agreed that the team may share information with her agent if she is too unwell to decide. The plan will be revisited in a year or sooner if her health changes. [S]</paragraph></text>

